        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;usequery-error-when-using-the-honojs-client-directly-typeerror-cannot-read-properties-of-undefined-reading-replace&#34;&gt;useQuery Error When Using the honojs Client Directly: TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading &amp;lsquo;replace&amp;rsquo;)
